Subject: [PATCH] Define the data of Sigma's, the enemies', Mima's and Marisa's
 TUs in C++

th02/main_dtl.asm is empty now. Sigma's tables are local initializers;
only the second one is word-aligned, so -a2 starts before its function
(it would also pad the 7-byte tile image struct).
